sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant CLI
    participant Orchestrator
    participant Cache as Local Cache
    participant YouTube
    participant Generator
    participant Gateway as Model Gateway
    participant Disk as Local Filesystem

    Note over User,Disk: NoteWise End-to-End Processing Flow<br/>What happens after "notewise process URL"

    User->>CLI: process URL
    CLI->>Orchestrator: resolve input, submit video

    Orchestrator->>Cache: check for cached result
    alt already cached, not forced
        Cache-->>Orchestrator: cached metadata + transcript
        Note over Orchestrator: skip network fetch
    else not cached or forced reprocessing
        Orchestrator->>YouTube: fetch metadata (rate-limited)
        YouTube-->>Orchestrator: title, duration, chapters
        Orchestrator->>YouTube: fetch transcript (rate-limited)
        alt transient failure
            YouTube-->>Orchestrator: temporary error
            Orchestrator->>YouTube: retry with backoff
        end
        YouTube-->>Orchestrator: transcript text
        Orchestrator->>Cache: persist video + transcript
    end

    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: check for chapter markers

    alt chapters available
        Orchestrator->>Generator: generate per chapter (bounded concurrency)
    else no usable chapters
        Orchestrator->>Generator: chunk transcript (token-bounded, with overlap)
    end

    loop each chunk or chapter
        Generator->>Gateway: request generation
        Gateway-->>Generator: text + token/cost usage
    end

    Generator->>Generator: stitch sections into one document
    Generator-->>Orchestrator: finished study notes

    par write requested formats
        Orchestrator->>Disk: write Markdown
    and
        Orchestrator->>Disk: write HTML / PDF / DOCX
    end

    opt quiz requested
        Orchestrator->>Generator: generate quiz
        Generator->>Gateway: request generation
        Gateway-->>Orchestrator: quiz document
        Orchestrator->>Disk: write quiz
    end

    Orchestrator->>Cache: persist run stats (tokens, cost, timing)
    Orchestrator-->>User: report cost and output paths
